She hired a lawyer and is trying to fight.

199
00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:25.180
No use.

200
00:22:28.220 --> 00:22:29.480
Do you know why?

201
00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:32.490
Because in the medical field I

202
