272
00:33:06.990 --> 00:33:08.290
Hey superhero!

273
00:33:10.960 --> 00:33:11.890
Are you having fun too?

274
00:33:12.630 --> 00:33:14.630
That's how to fight, right?

275
00:33:16.560 --> 00:33:17.400
Exactly.

276
00:33:21.160 --> 00:33:22.640
Do you know why this happens?

277
00:33:24.910 --> 00:33:26.160
Because we both...

278
00:33:26.240 --> 00:33:27.170
right here...

279
00:33:27.780 --> 00:33:29.140
Big problems.

280
00:33:31.180 --> 00:33:32.310
Both of us.

281
00:33:33.050 --> 00:33:34.880
We're just pathetic trash.

282
00:33:58.270 --> 00:33:59.210
Are you laughing?

283
00:34:06.350 --> 00:34:07.640
Don't make me laugh.

284
00:34:07.720 --> 00:34:08.680
I...

285
